1. Install Kubectl
2. Download Kubeconfig file from rancher of the cluster.
3. Make Directory and change permission accordingly

  mkdir -p ~/.kube
  chmod 700 ~/.kube

4. Copy the file on the server
5.  Move the file in the .kube folder
    mv ~/<<file name>> ~/.kube/config
    chmod 600 ~/.kube/config

6. Check the API server address

    grep 'server:' ~/.kube/config

7. Verify the cluster

    kubectl get nodes -o wide
    kubectl get pods -A
